  "title": "Stratoshark: Update Default Event name column",
  "description": "As part of the underlying sysdig changes, the sysdig.event_name field no longer reflects the actual system call being used. Updating the default column to evt.type.\n\nI also found in validation that I needed to delete my Default profile from the profiles dialog for the update to come through. I'm not sure if there's a way to force that update through the user's cached default profile\n\nAssisted-by: Gemini (chat only)",
